cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Crater2Impactor: Impactor Parameter Estimation from Lunar Impact Craters"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
authors:
  - family-names: Pandey
    given-names: Adarsh
  - family-names: Purohit
    given-names: Suchit
type: software
version: 2.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Adarsh-61/Crater2Impactor"
abstract: >-
  Posterior inference of impactor mass, energy, momentum, size and speed from the rim
  diameter of a simple lunar crater, with optional independent observations (impact
  speed, angle, mass, flash energy, ejecta pattern). Point-source crater scaling with
  three named constant sets, a layered regolith target model and declared impactor
  populations are combined by importance sampling under explicit, swappable priors.
  Validation uses laboratory craters, eleven lunar spacecraft impacts and the
  observed production rate of new lunar craters.
